OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'selfless' grandfather
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a "caring and selfless"
OL,7,Fgrandfather have paid tribute to him
OL,8,Fdays after he was killed in a car
OL,9,Fcrash.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police said the crash
OL,12,Finvolving a white Omoda 7 and a silver
OL,13,FHonda Jazz occurred on the A415 between
OL,14,FStandlake and Witney just before 09:30
OL,15,FGMT on Saturday.
OL,17,FThe driver of the Honda, 67-year-old
OL,18,FJohn Dillon, died at the scene. No
OL,19,Farrests have been made in connection
OL,20,Fwith the incident, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
